{"id":"03f2d34d9851bee4","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-cohomology.md","title":"Cohomology","display":"df-cohomology — Cohomology","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-cohomology","aliases":["58-df-cohomology","Cohomology","Cohomology Theory"],"display":"df-cohomology — Cohomology","depends_on":["[[58-df-chain-complex]]","[[58-df-abelian-group]]","[[58-df-homomorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-cohomology"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-cohomology</span><span>Cohomology</span><span>Cohomology Theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cohomology — Cohomology"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c3537edf2017d84e\" href=\"?note=c3537edf2017d84e\" title=\"58-df-chain-complex\">58-df-chain-complex</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9f54a13cf4872f4e\" href=\"?note=9f54a13cf4872f4e\" title=\"58-df-abelian-group\">58-df-abelian-group</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f32a973b59a825e4\" href=\"?note=f32a973b59a825e4\" title=\"58-df-homomorphism\">58-df-homomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,+,d\\in V\">\\(C,+,d\\in V\\)</span> 是集合编码的函数，定义域均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Z\">\\(\\mathbb Z\\)</span>；记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,+,d\\in V^{\\mathbb Z}\">\\(C,+,d\\in V^{\\mathbb Z}\\)</span> 仅缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(C,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}C)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}+)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(d,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}d)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(C,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}C)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}+)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(d,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}d)\\)</span>，不把真类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 当作幂集运算的集合参数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(G,+_G)\">\\(\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(G,+_G)\\)</span> (abelian-group predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9f54a13cf4872f4e\" href=\"?note=9f54a13cf4872f4e\" title=\"58-df-abelian-group\">58-df-abelian-group</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(f,G,+_G,H,+_H)\">\\(\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(f,G,+_G,H,+_H)\\)</span> (group-homomorphism predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f32a973b59a825e4\" href=\"?note=f32a973b59a825e4\" title=\"58-df-homomorphism\">58-df-homomorphism</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S(z,G,+_G)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S(z,G,+_G)\\)</span> (zero-element predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c3537edf2017d84e\" href=\"?note=c3537edf2017d84e\" title=\"58-df-chain-complex\">58-df-chain-complex</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CochainComplex}_S(C,+,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{CochainComplex}_S(C,+,d)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CocycleGroup}_S(n;C,+,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{CocycleGroup}_S(n;C,+,d)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CoboundaryGroup}_S(n;C,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{CoboundaryGroup}_S(n;C,d)\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cohomology}_S(H,n;C,+,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cohomology}_S(H,n;C,+,d)\\)</span> (cohomology-object predicate defined here)</li>\n<li>商群的底集使用下列显式陪集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CohomologyClass}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CohomologyClass}_S\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CohomologyAddition}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CohomologyAddition}_S\\)</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CochainComplex}_S(C,+,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{CochainComplex}_S(C,+,d)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span> 及相应的上闭链参数域上取值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cochain\\text{-}complex} \\vdash \\mathrm{CochainComplex}_S(C,+,d)\\leftrightarrow C,+,d\\in V^{\\mathbb Z}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(C(n),+(n))\\land\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(d(n),C(n),+(n),C(n+1),+(n+1))\\land\\exists z\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S(z,C(n+2),+(n+2))\\land\\forall x\\in C(n)\\;(d(n+1)(d(n)(x))=z)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cochain\\text{-}complex} \\vdash \\mathrm{CochainComplex}_S(C,+,d)\\leftrightarrow C,+,d\\in V^{\\mathbb Z}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(C(n),+(n))\\land\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(d(n),C(n),+(n),C(n+1),+(n+1))\\land\\exists z\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S(z,C(n+2),+(n+2))\\land\\forall x\\in C(n)\\;(d(n+1)(d(n)(x))=z)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cohomology\\text{-}cocycles} \\vdash n\\in\\mathbb Z\\to\\mathrm{CocycleGroup}_S(n;C,+,d)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in C(n):\\exists z\\;(\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S(z,C(n+1),+(n+1))\\land d(n)(x)=z)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cohomology\\text{-}cocycles} \\vdash n\\in\\mathbb Z\\to\\mathrm{CocycleGroup}_S(n;C,+,d)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in C(n):\\exists z\\;(\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S(z,C(n+1),+(n+1))\\land d(n)(x)=z)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cohomology\\text{-}coboundaries} \\vdash n\\in\\mathbb Z\\to\\mathrm{CoboundaryGroup}_S(n;C,d)\\coloneqq\\{d(n-1)(y):y\\in C(n-1)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cohomology\\text{-}coboundaries} \\vdash n\\in\\mathbb Z\\to\\mathrm{CoboundaryGroup}_S(n;C,d)\\coloneqq\\{d(n-1)(y):y\\in C(n-1)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CochainComplex}_S(C,+,d)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\n\\land x\\in\\mathrm{CocycleGroup}_S(n;C,+,d)\\to\n\\mathrm{CohomologyClass}_S(n,x;C,+,d)\\coloneqq\n\\{+(n)(\\langle x,b\\rangle):b\\in\\mathrm{CoboundaryGroup}_S(n;C,d)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CochainComplex}_S(C,+,d)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\n\\land x\\in\\mathrm{CocycleGroup}_S(n;C,+,d)\\to\n\\mathrm{CohomologyClass}_S(n,x;C,+,d)\\coloneqq\n\\{+(n)(\\langle x,b\\rangle):b\\in\\mathrm{CoboundaryGroup}_S(n;C,d)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CochainComplex}_S(C,+,d)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\to\n\\mathrm{CohomologyAddition}_S(n;C,+,d)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{\\bigl\\langle\n\\langle\\mathrm{CohomologyClass}_S(n,x;C,+,d),\\mathrm{CohomologyClass}_S(n,y;C,+,d)\\rangle,\n\\mathrm{CohomologyClass}_S(n,+(n)(\\langle x,y\\rangle);C,+,d)\n\\bigr\\rangle:x,y\\in\\mathrm{CocycleGroup}_S(n;C,+,d)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CochainComplex}_S(C,+,d)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\to\n\\mathrm{CohomologyAddition}_S(n;C,+,d)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{\\bigl\\langle\n\\langle\\mathrm{CohomologyClass}_S(n,x;C,+,d),\\mathrm{CohomologyClass}_S(n,y;C,+,d)\\rangle,\n\\mathrm{CohomologyClass}_S(n,+(n)(\\langle x,y\\rangle);C,+,d)\n\\bigr\\rangle:x,y\\in\\mathrm{CocycleGroup}_S(n;C,+,d)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cohomology} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cohomology}_S(H,n;C,+,d)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CochainComplex}_S(C,+,d)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\land H=\\{\\mathrm{CohomologyClass}_S(n,x;C,+,d):x\\in\\mathrm{CocycleGroup}_S(n;C,+,d)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cohomology} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cohomology}_S(H,n;C,+,d)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CochainComplex}_S(C,+,d)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\land H=\\{\\mathrm{CohomologyClass}_S(n,x;C,+,d):x\\in\\mathrm{CocycleGroup}_S(n;C,+,d)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Cohomology is the kernel of one coboundary modulo the image of the preceding coboundary.</li>\n<li>The universal-coefficient statement is kept in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3ff9bab1e15a730d\" href=\"?note=3ff9bab1e15a730d\" title=\"58-thm-universal-coeff\">58-thm-universal-coeff</a>, where its maps and exactness belong.</li>\n<li>Cup product: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^*(X) \\times H^*(X) \\to H^*(X)\">\\(H^*(X) \\times H^*(X) \\to H^*(X)\\)</span> gives ring structure</li>\n<li>Alexander-Spanier, Cech, singular cohomology</li>\n<li>De Rham cohomology: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^*_{\\mathrm{dR}}(M) \\cong H^*(X; \\mathbb{R})\">\\(H^*_{\\mathrm{dR}}(M) \\cong H^*(X; \\mathbb{R})\\)</span> for smooth manifolds</li>\n<li>Sheaf cohomology: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^i(X, \\mathcal{F})\">\\(H^i(X, \\mathcal{F})\\)</span> for sheaf <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hatcher, Algebraic Topology</li>\n<li>Bott and Tu, Differential Forms in Algebraic Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-chain-complex","status":"resolved","id":"c3537edf2017d84e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-chain-complex]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-abelian-group","status":"resolved","id":"9f54a13cf4872f4e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-abelian-group]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"f32a973b59a825e4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-abelian-group","status":"resolved","id":"9f54a13cf4872f4e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(G,+_G)$ (abelian-group predicate, see [[58-df-abelian-group]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"f32a973b59a825e4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(f,G,+_G,H,+_H)$ (group-homomorphism predicate, see [[58-df-homomorphism]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-chain-complex","status":"resolved","id":"c3537edf2017d84e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S(z,G,+_G)$ (zero-element predicate, see [[58-df-chain-complex]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-thm-universal-coeff","status":"resolved","id":"3ff9bab1e15a730d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"The universal-coefficient statement is kept in [[58-thm-universal-coeff]], where its maps and exactness belong.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C,+,d\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"C,+,d\\in V^{\\mathbb Z}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(C,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}C)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}+)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(d,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}d)","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(G,+_G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(f,G,+_G,H,+_H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S(z,G,+_G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CochainComplex}_S(C,+,d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CocycleGroup}_S(n;C,+,d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CoboundaryGroup}_S(n;C,d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cohomology}_S(H,n;C,+,d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CohomologyClass}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CohomologyAddition}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CochainComplex}_S(C,+,d)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cochain\\text{-}complex} \\vdash \\mathrm{CochainComplex}_S(C,+,d)\\leftrightarrow C,+,d\\in V^{\\mathbb Z}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(C(n),+(n))\\land\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(d(n),C(n),+(n),C(n+1),+(n+1))\\land\\exists z\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S(z,C(n+2),+(n+2))\\land\\forall x\\in C(n)\\;(d(n+1)(d(n)(x))=z)\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cohomology\\text{-}cocycles} \\vdash n\\in\\mathbb Z\\to\\mathrm{CocycleGroup}_S(n;C,+,d)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in C(n):\\exists z\\;(\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S(z,C(n+1),+(n+1))\\land d(n)(x)=z)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cohomology\\text{-}coboundaries} \\vdash n\\in\\mathbb Z\\to\\mathrm{CoboundaryGroup}_S(n;C,d)\\coloneqq\\{d(n-1)(y):y\\in C(n-1)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CochainComplex}_S(C,+,d)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\n\\land x\\in\\mathrm{CocycleGroup}_S(n;C,+,d)\\to\n\\mathrm{CohomologyClass}_S(n,x;C,+,d)\\coloneqq\n\\{+(n)(\\langle x,b\\rangle):b\\in\\mathrm{CoboundaryGroup}_S(n;C,d)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CochainComplex}_S(C,+,d)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\to\n\\mathrm{CohomologyAddition}_S(n;C,+,d)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{\\bigl\\langle\n\\langle\\mathrm{CohomologyClass}_S(n,x;C,+,d),\\mathrm{CohomologyClass}_S(n,y;C,+,d)\\rangle,\n\\mathrm{CohomologyClass}_S(n,+(n)(\\langle x,y\\rangle);C,+,d)\n\\bigr\\rangle:x,y\\in\\mathrm{CocycleGroup}_S(n;C,+,d)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cohomology} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cohomology}_S(H,n;C,+,d)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CochainComplex}_S(C,+,d)\\land n\\in\\mathbb Z\\land H=\\{\\mathrm{CohomologyClass}_S(n,x;C,+,d):x\\in\\mathrm{CocycleGroup}_S(n;C,+,d)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"H^*(X) \\times H^*(X) \\to H^*(X)","display":false},{"tex":"H^*_{\\mathrm{dR}}(M) \\cong H^*(X; \\mathbb{R})","display":false},{"tex":"H^i(X, \\mathcal{F})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{F}","display":false}],"bytes":3556,"backlinks":[{"id":"8ee356c2b76fa7ec","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"213ce75a48289483","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{CochainComplex}$、$\\mathrm{Cohomology}$、$\\mathrm{CohomologyAddition}$ 取 [[../batch16/58-df-cohomology.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"4c849eff8e22e2c7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"35045d72c4959e18","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$H$ (chosen Weil cohomology theory, see [[58-df-cohomology]])"},{"id":"5edfa66c6abe1ecc","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f9dfa70ca901c287","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7c0eb208441d0c3e","an